{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barrelbots</strong> is a grid-based puzzle game where you play as small robots that can grab, stack, and carry barrels of nuclear waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/0bd91c31b6176bd7a0d56b8197b5ef32.poster.avif?t=1756217672\" aria-label=\"a robot grabs a barrel, turns, and carries it into a waste chute.\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/0bd91c31b6176bd7a0d56b8197b5ef32.webm?t=1756217672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/0bd91c31b6176bd7a0d56b8197b5ef32.mp4?t=1756217672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each handcrafted level offers a little &quot;aha&quot; - a new idea or clever interaction you didn\u2019t notice at first, but once you do, you\u2019ll wonder how you ever missed it. The rules are simple and intuitive, but they open into surprisingly deep possibilities - with a few unexpected twists... ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/444e01f7e31ab5a8ad345ab5724b1cac.poster.avif?t=1756217672\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/444e01f7e31ab5a8ad345ab5724b1cac.webm?t=1756217672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/444e01f7e31ab5a8ad345ab5724b1cac.mp4?t=1756217672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility notes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad will be fully supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undos and resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No puzzles based on audio, timing, or colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time or move limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not necessary to complete every single puzzle in order to progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/326d903287bd356b5f84ab70d88c8b91.poster.avif?t=1756217672\" width=780 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/326d903287bd356b5f84ab70d88c8b91.webm?t=1756217672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/extras/326d903287bd356b5f84ab70d88c8b91.mp4?t=1756217672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3851470?t=1756217672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/36095968566e94341a90924984d287bc73811bd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756217672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/e378c595690fae8cff64b6d7cc2d7667414d26ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756217672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851470/e378c595690fae8cff64b6d7cc2d7667414d26ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756217672",